BMC Helix automatically detects collisions when:

```text
SAME CI / SERVICE
+
OVERLAPPING IMPLEMENTATION WINDOWS
```

and supports impact analysis for dependent CIs.

The system also exposes:

- conflicting change;
- CI;
- status;
- coordinator;
- scheduled dates;
- collision status;
- business justification;
- audit history.



